WEBVTT

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.744
(Lyrics) Satan!

00:10:02.768 --> 00:10:09.245
(Unintelligible lyrics continue)

00:10:16.934 --> 00:10:18.554
What did you get?
Audience: Satan!

00:10:18.578 --> 00:10:20.290
Satan. OK, at least we got "Satan".

00:10:20.314 --> 00:10:22.616
Now, I'll prime the auditory
part of your brain

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:26.077
to tell you what you're supposed
to hear, and then hear it again.

00:10:26.101 --> 00:10:29.902
(Music with lyrics)